{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0d49aa9dc5a833d913b","chatId":"5f199cde6316446c98013d12b6e5792b","sessionId":null,"userId":98782,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1800,"promptTokens":1501,"completionTokens":137,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:48"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005217477360597622,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0d49aa9dc5a833d913a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482388963,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0d49aa9dc5a833d913a","chatId":"5f199cde6316446c98013d12b6e5792b","sessionId":null,"userId":98782,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n来自中国的高小峰和朋友们吃饭一般都不会走AA制，而是让其中一个人买单。有一天他带了一个美国的朋友参加饭局。饭后，美国的朋友自然而然地掏出了信用卡，准备AA。高小峰笑着拒绝了。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，高小峰最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 惊讶\nB) 爱护\nC) 气恼\nD) 尴尬\nE) 害怕\nF) 反对\n\n## 问题 2\n高小峰为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他很感激亨利的好意，但他愿意为这顿饭买单\nB) 他被这昂贵的餐点吓到了\nC) 他想通过付账来炫耀他的财富\nD) 他和他的朋友们打赌，赌谁会付账单","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005217477360597622,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0d49aa9dc5a833d913b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482388961,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"6054683cdbe74156a10a2ad0c1e7c10f"}